            "title": "\"It was such an amazing investment. As a reactive dog owner, with a virtual outlet I was able to have access to a trainer in a way that kept everyone safe.",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p><p><br/><strong>Anna & Bruno<br/></strong>Rodgers, AR</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://youtu.be/EXt96K74My4",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        },
        "text_block_Wtm7hk": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-04-08_at_12.13.40_PM.png",
            "title": "\"When we started, she was having accidents and destroying her crate all the time. And now she’s completely fine and is very comfortable in her space. I’m constantly impressed by how much she’ll stay and wait for us. She’s way better on a leash. I’m very happy with what we learned.\"",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐<br/><br/><strong>Peter & Whiskey</strong><br/>Los Angeles, CA</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=4MiJiAIguKg",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        },
        "text_block_4kwaAC": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-04-08_at_12.17.48_PM.png",
            "title": "\"The training that Choopie and I received is phenomenal! Our trainer, Shannen, was so kind, so understanding, and so professional! So extremely helpful! I didn't have 1 single doubt that this is where we should get our training from! 10/10 absolutely recommend, I've already starting recommending them to my friends, family, and a couple strangers!\"",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p><p><strong>Kaitlynn & Choopie</strong><br/>Columbus, OH</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=-jMMBHznTGQ",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        },
        "text_block_VahHhX": {
          "type": "text_block",
          "settings": {
            "image": "shopify://shop_images/Screen_Shot_2024-04-08_at_12.18.51_PM.png",
            "title": "Homeschool by LAY LO has TRULY changed my life! This was my very first time owning a puppy on my own and I had no idea what I was doing. Well 8 weeks later I’m happy to say my dog is fully crate trained! Our trainer was so patient with us and provided all the support I needed to help my dog and I get through this process. I recommend this program to anyone interested in getting their pup trained!!",
            "text": "<p>⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p><p><strong>Dominoe & Willa</strong><br/>Los Angeles, CA</p>",
            "button_text": "",
            "button_link": "",
            "button_style": "btn--text",
            "video_link_popup": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=wK7bcT9GAO4",
            "video_link_color": "text-light"
          }
        }
      },
