    "section_accordions_Cni8mr": {
      "type": "section-accordions",
      "blocks": {
        "text_WntRfm": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Why do you train online?",
            "text": "<p>Science has proven that the best environment for your pup to learn is <br/>without distractions. Training outside of the home brings not only new <br/>smells but new people and other dogs to get excited about which breaks <br/>your dog’s focus and slows down the behavior modification process. <br/>That’s why we only offer virtual training at home so you and your pup <br/>can make progress together ASAP. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_FyFnRD": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How much time do you spend with my dog?",
            "text": "<p>With Homeschool, YOU become the expert in training your dog throughout the program and beyond. It takes 1,000 repetitions to shape a dog’s behavior – which is why outside of our 45-min, 1:1 video sessions we check-in daily via text and are available for any questions so you can get faster results.</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_VprdQ7": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is virtual training?",
            "text": "<p>Virtual training is quickly becoming the most effective training method to get long-term results. Through weekly 1:1 video calls with your <br/>dedicated trainer, we demonstrate the training techniques and watch as <br/>you practice in real time with your pup. After each call, we'll provide <br/>homework and video lessons to track your progress. Still curious? Watch a sample virtual training lesson <a href=\"https://fub.direct/1/-8r8SWmgQ6mGu0nIMQoO0KB48bJeKRwbhImxJ_eJbkJmAVQstrWW-CwiqVOlv9bO1XaggZc-7wdj10103TwdJQ/https/www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.instagram.com/p/Cp8R9bcA2XA/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">here</span></a> &gt;</p>"
          }
        },
        "text_RLLaqR": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What is your training philosophy?",
            "text": "<p>We are proud to stand behind positive-reinforcement training practices, the most powerful tool recognized by PETA, the ASPCA, and the Humane <br/>Society of America to transform your pup’s behavior. All of our trainers<br/> are force-free certified experts ensuring that the techniques you learn<br/> are promoting a positive and healthy relationship between you and your <br/>pup. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_Uakjzx": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Are your trainers certified?",
            "text": "<p>Our trainers are some of the best in the country with Fear Free™ <br/>certifications from institutions such as The University of Washington <br/>Animal Behavior College, Karen Pryor Academy, Cambridge Institute of <br/>Canine Behaviour, Training and Brenda Aloff Fundamentals, and more. </p>"
          }
        },
        "text_G4Ck8H": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does virtual training work?",
            "text": "<p>We’ve worked with pet parents across the country to transform their <br/>dog’s behavior from complex reactivity issues to puppy training, the <a href=\"https://fub.direct/1/eeU_0HM1yBmykb6BMUt4kvI5Y9JJqzvM70XERtK0ytjfA98XIpYTk1yu-xKRc9B1yW29Km2EIGnDZ_ZfOpcq7w/https/www.bark.com/settings/profile/my_profile/?&ps=reviews\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.bark.com/settings/profile/my_profile/?&ps=reviews\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">dozens of video reviews</span></a> we have speak for themselves.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
